We can solve this with a brute force solution by checking every letter that satisfy the condition. Here is the code.

public class FindW {
public static void main(String args[]) {
int i=0;
System.out.println(i);
}
for(char w: "ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ") {
if(w=='W') {
i++;
System.out.print(w+' ');
}
}
}

It will produce the following output.

Output

4
Wed

Note

In the first sample, only 4 days satisfy the condition.

In the second sample, only one day has the required property.
